#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:10
msgid "Migrations Documentation Overhaul for 9.0.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:12
msgid "Objective"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:14
msgid ""
"Rewrite the Tools > Migrations documentation to accurately reflect the "
"current capabilities of the bulk migration feature, targeting IT "
"Operations teams migrating from VMware to HVM. Remove outdated "
"limitations, document the automated Windows driver injection workflow, "
"and clarify the technical architecture at an operator-friendly level."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:16
msgid "Key Changes from Code Review"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:18
msgid ""
"**No VM batch limit** — all VMs in a plan run in parallel (was "
"incorrectly stated as 20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:19
msgid ""
"**Automated Windows VirtIO driver injection** — SATA→VirtIO bus swap with"
" helper disk, no manual prep needed for driver injection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:20
msgid "**ISO fallback** for Windows VirtIO install when network MSI fails"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:21
msgid ""
"**Agent pulls disks from VMware** over HTTPS (HttpNfcLease), not NFS — "
"async NFS note is irrelevant"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:22
msgid "**QCOW2 thin provisioning** on GFS2/NFS targets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:23
msgid "**Ceph RBD support** as a target datastore"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:24
msgid "**UEFI boot support** preserved from source"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:25
msgid "**MAC address preservation** optional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:26
msgid "**48-hour transfer timeout**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:27
msgid "**Storage controller mapping** — SCSI→VirtIO-SCSI, IDE/SATA→VirtIO Block"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:29
msgid "Target Audience"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:31
msgid ""
"VMware IT Operations teams evaluating or executing migration from vSphere"
" to HPE Morpheus HVM. Assume familiarity with VMware concepts (vCenter, "
"datastores, networks) but not with KVM/libvirt internals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:33
msgid "Scope"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/migrations-docs-9/spec.md:35
